# Copy to apps/riftbound-app/.env (gitignored) to enable the "VS Claude" opponent
# without pasting a key into the browser. Bun loads .env from the working
# directory; the server also reads this file's ANTHROPIC_API_KEY when started
# from elsewhere. Never commit a real key.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional: RB_AI_MOCK=1 swaps in a first-legal-action bot through the same code path (no network).
